This role is ideal for someone who enjoys being at the centre of a busy marketing function, is equally comfortable running an event, managing an agency, briefing a senior stakeholder, reviewing campaign performance or supporting a wider marketing campaign , and who can quickly move between strategic thinking and hands-on execution. &nbsp;

The successful candidate will play a key role in translating Capco’s consulting capabilities into integrated go-to-market activity , combining thought leadership, digital engagement and senior client events to strengthen market visibility, deepen relationships with priority clients and support pipeline generation. &nbsp;

&nbsp;

